## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cffd4af37The Imperium|r
## Notes: Official addon of <The Imperium>. Guild kill and level-up alerts, shared logs and leaderboards, a wanted list of gankers, raid sign-ups and DKP with loot auctions, and officer guild tools.
## Author: The Imperium
## Version: 2.12.0
## Category: Guild
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\TheImperium\Media\Icon
## AddonCompartmentFunc: TheImperium_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: TheImperium_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: TheImperium_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
## OptionalDeps: TomTom, OpenMap
## SavedVariables: TheImperiumDB
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1803056

# Files load in this order, and each one may use what loaded before it.
# Keep the order when moving or adding files.

# 1. Foundations: namespace, events and messages; the release reset; guild roster and settings
Core\Core.lua
Core\Release.lua
Guild\Guild.lua

# 2. Alerts: PvP kills, deaths (for the Wanted list), the Wanted list, level-ups
PvP\Deaths.lua
PvP\Kills.lua
PvP\Wanted.lua
Guild\Celebrations.lua

# 3. Shared history: syncing logs, clearing logs, the shared ledger
Core\Sync.lua
Core\Wipes.lua
Core\Ledger.lua

# 4. Raids and DKP (kept in the ledger)
Raids\Raids.lua
Raids\DKP.lua

# 5. Officer log and the weekly recap
Guild\OfficerLog.lua
Guild\Recap.lua

# 6. Interface: the theme, shared widgets and the guild panel
UI\Theme.lua
UI\Widgets.lua
UI\Panel.lua

# 7. The panel's tabs
UI\Tabs\Roster.lua
UI\Tabs\Raids.lua
UI\Tabs\DKP.lua
UI\Tabs\DKPTools.lua
UI\Tabs\KillLog.lua
UI\Tabs\Wanted.lua
UI\Tabs\Settings.lua
UI\Tabs\OfficerLog.lua
UI\Tabs\AddonUsers.lua

# 8. Map pins, minimap button, loot auction window, updates panel
UI\MapPins.lua
UI\MapPins.xml
UI\MinimapButton.lua
